## Review loops

<% package['loops'].each do |loop| %>
<h3><%= escape(loop['title']) %></h3>
<p><%= escape(loop['outcome']) %></p>
<ul><% loop['checks'].each do |check| %><li><%= escape(check) %></li><% end %></ul>
<% end %>

Repeat the loop whenever a check fails: correct the deliverable or record a confirmed audit finding, rerun the affected checks, then verify the full coverage ledger. A proposal is not a pass for the underlying component. Do not keep a review marked complete after its recorded scope changes.

