## Scope and limits

The starting revision is `2dfeb5272eaf27c100dcb50b59f20220918a2d41`. The review covers authored documentation, examples, shared presentation code, design tokens and maintained component source. New guidance is reviewed before it is used as the audit standard. The machine records preserve file evidence and the reviewed scope.

This package does not change live household configuration or certify every native Home Assistant component. Automated checks cover specific markup and behaviour; screen-reader usability, household comprehension and live device behaviour need separately recorded testing. Keep those untested boundaries visible in the [audit](design-system-audit.html).
